 "id": "cases/evolve-fuse-kstar",
 "type": "fyo:ScenarioSpecification",
 "title": {
  "zh": "FUSE · KSTAR（输入对照，不是 FUSE 的答案）",
  "en": "FUSE · KSTAR (inputs only, not FUSE's answer)"
 },
 "note": {
  "zh": "★★<strong>这不是 FUSE 的答案，是 FUSE 的输入。</strong>KSTAR 这一档的机器、成分与注入功率取自 FUSE 的 <code>case_parameters(:KSTAR)</code>（commit <code>494d565</code>，<code>src/cases/KSTAR.jl</code>）；而 FUSE 给出的<strong>结果</strong>来自 <code>ActorStationaryPlasma</code>——TGLF 通量匹配加 EPED 台基的迭代，本栏走的是<strong>规定 χ 的推进</strong>。χ₀ = 0.4 m²/s 是本仓 ITER 对标（对 ASTRA）定下的，<strong>没有为这台机器重新标定过</strong>，FUSE 也从来没给过它。所以这一档跑出来的数<strong>不能拿去和 FUSE 对</strong>——能对的是下面那张表里标着 FUSE 的那些格。 ★<strong>本仓不携带 FUSE 的任何东西</strong>：这份文档里是从一个 FUSE 检出里读出的标量，出处逐条写在下面；源码与数据文件都没有进仓。 ★控件 · FUSE 的值 · 落到控件 · 出处： · <code>amin</code> · 0.460187 · <strong>0.45</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] a = R₀ϵ = 1.77721×0.258938 · <code>rmaj</code> · 3.86192 · <strong>3.85</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] R/a = 1/ϵ = 3.86192 · <code>kappa</code> · 1.73951 · <strong>1.74</strong> · [FUSE] MXH_params：κ 直接取，δ = sin(s₁) = sin(0.541526) · <code>delta</code> · 0.515445 · <strong>0.52</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] MXH_params：κ 直接取，δ = sin(s₁) = sin(0.541526) · <code>bunit</code> · -1.8 · <strong>1.8</strong> · [FUSE] ini.equilibrium.B0（取模） · <code>ip</code> · 800000 · <strong>800</strong> · [FUSE] ini.equilibrium.ip，A → kA · <code>q95</code> · — · <strong>3.4</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] FUSE 不给 q₉₅（它由平衡解出）；用柱近似加形状因子估：5a²B/(R₀I_p) = 1.341，形状因子 2.568（★是估计，不是 FUSE 的答案） · <code>zeff</code> · 2 · <strong>2</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.zeff · <code>cimp</code> · — · <strong>3.33</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] 由控件 Z_eff 反解本栏的 1 + c·Z(Z−1)，Z(C) = 6；落格后隐含 Z_eff = 1.999 · <code>dtfrac</code> · — · <strong>0.4</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] ★FUSE 这一档是**纯氘**（bulk = :D），本栏没有这一档成分：α 已关，这一格因此不进结果，填的是准中性下的体离子占比 0.4001 · <code>species</code> · C · <strong>C</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.impurity · <code>peakt</code> · 1.8 · <strong>1.8</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.Te_shaping · <code>peakn</code> · 0.9 · <strong>0.9</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.ne_shaping · <code>te0</code> · 2000 · <strong>2</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.Te_core，eV → keV · <code>ti0</code> · — · <strong>2</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] T_i(0) = T_e(0) × Ti_Te_ratio = 1 · <code>edgene</code> · — · <strong>3.6</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] ne_setting = :greenwald_fraction_ped，f_G,ped = 0.3 × n_G = 12.02×10¹⁹ · <code>ne0</code> · — · <strong>5</strong> · [★本仓的，不是 FUSE 的] FUSE 不给芯部密度（它是通量匹配的结果）；芯/台基比沿用本仓 ITER 档的 10.0/7.0 = 1.43 · <code>edgete</code> · 300 · <strong>0.3</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.Te_ped，eV → keV · <code>edgeti</code> · — · <strong>0.3</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] T_ped × Ti_Te_ratio · <code>pe</code> · — · <strong>1.5</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] ★分配是本工具的约定，不是 FUSE 的：EC 0 + LH 0 + NB 3/2 → 电子 · IC 0 + NB 3/2 → 离子 · <code>pi</code> · — · <strong>1.5</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] 同上 · <code>pedestal</code> · — · <strong>False</strong> · [★本仓的，不是 FUSE 的] FUSE 这一档自己写死了 Te_ped，就用它，台基模型不开 ★<strong>落格</strong>（滑杆有自己的步长，文档写的就是页面真正持有的值，不是 FUSE 的原值）：<code>amin</code> 0.460187→0.45 · <code>rmaj</code> 3.86192→3.85 · <code>kappa</code> 1.73951→1.74 · <code>delta</code> 0.515445→0.52 · <code>q95</code> 3.44287→3.4 · <code>cimp</code> 3.33333→3.33 · <code>dtfrac</code> 0.4001→0.4 · <code>edgene</code> 3.60738→3.6 · <code>ne0</code> 5.1534→5 ★本栏其余控件（dt、步数、闭包、波与束流那几组）是本仓的缺省，FUSE 的 ini 里没有对应项。",
  "en": "★★<strong>This is FUSE's INPUT, not FUSE's ANSWER.</strong> The machine, composition and launched power of the KSTAR case come from FUSE's <code>case_parameters(:KSTAR)</code> (commit <code>494d565</code>, <code>src/cases/KSTAR.jl</code>). FUSE's own answer comes out of <code>ActorStationaryPlasma</code> — a TGLF flux match with an EPED pedestal — whereas this bar marches a <strong>prescribed chi</strong>. chi_0 = 0.4 m^2/s is what this repository's ITER benchmark against ASTRA settled on; it was <strong>not re-derived for this machine</strong> and FUSE never stated it. So the numbers this case produces are <strong>not comparable with FUSE's</strong>; what is comparable is the half of the table below tagged FUSE. ★<strong>Nothing of FUSE's is carried in this repository</strong>: what is here are scalars read out of a FUSE checkout, each with its provenance below. No source and no data file was copied. ★control · FUSE · as held · provenance： · <code>amin</code> · 0.460187 · <strong>0.45</strong> · [derived from FUSE] a = R₀ϵ = 1.77721×0.258938 · <code>rmaj</code> · 3.86192 · <strong>3.85</strong> · [derived from FUSE] R/a = 1/ϵ = 3.86192 · <code>kappa</code> · 1.73951 · <strong>1.74</strong> · [FUSE] MXH_params：κ 直接取，δ = sin(s₁) = sin(0.541526) · <code>delta</code> · 0.515445 · <strong>0.52</strong> · [derived from FUSE] MXH_params：κ 直接取，δ = sin(s₁) = sin(0.541526) · <code>bunit</code> · -1.8 · <strong>1.8</strong> · [FUSE] ini.equilibrium.B0（取模） · <code>ip</code> · 800000 · <strong>800</strong> · [FUSE] ini.equilibrium.ip，A → kA · <code>q95</code> · — · <strong>3.4</strong> · [derived from FUSE] FUSE 不给 q₉₅（它由平衡解出）；用柱近似加形状因子估：5a²B/(R₀I_p) = 1.341，形状因子 2.568（★是估计，不是 FUSE 的答案） · <code>zeff</code> · 2 · <strong>2</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.zeff · <code>cimp</code> · — · <strong>3.33</strong> · [derived from FUSE] 由控件 Z_eff 反解本栏的 1 + c·Z(Z−1)，Z(C) = 6；落格后隐含 Z_eff = 1.999 · <code>dtfrac</code> · — · <strong>0.4</strong> · [derived from FUSE] ★FUSE 这一档是**纯氘**（bulk = :D），本栏没有这一档成分：α 已关，这一格因此不进结果，填的是准中性下的体离子占比 0.4001 · <code>species</code> · C · <strong>C</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.impurity · <code>peakt</code> · 1.8 · <strong>1.8</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.Te_shaping · <code>peakn</code> · 0.9 · <strong>0.9</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.ne_shaping · <code>te0</code> · 2000 · <strong>2</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.Te_core，eV → keV · <code>ti0</code> · — · <strong>2</strong> · [derived from FUSE] T_i(0) = T_e(0) × Ti_Te_ratio = 1 · <code>edgene</code> · — · <strong>3.6</strong> · [derived from FUSE] ne_setting = :greenwald_fraction_ped，f_G,ped = 0.3 × n_G = 12.02×10¹⁹ · <code>ne0</code> · — · <strong>5</strong> · [★this repository, NOT FUSE] FUSE 不给芯部密度（它是通量匹配的结果）；芯/台基比沿用本仓 ITER 档的 10.0/7.0 = 1.43 · <code>edgete</code> · 300 · <strong>0.3</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.Te_ped，eV → keV · <code>edgeti</code> · — · <strong>0.3</strong> · [derived from FUSE] T_ped × Ti_Te_ratio · <code>pe</code> · — · <strong>1.5</strong> · [derived from FUSE] ★分配是本工具的约定，不是 FUSE 的：EC 0 + LH 0 + NB 3/2 → 电子 · IC 0 + NB 3/2 → 离子 · <code>pi</code> · — · <strong>1.5</strong> · [derived from FUSE] 同上 · <code>pedestal</code> · — · <strong>False</strong> · [★this repository, NOT FUSE] FUSE 这一档自己写死了 Te_ped，就用它，台基模型不开 ★<strong>Snapped to the slider lattice</strong> (the document states what the page actually holds, not FUSE's exact value): <code>amin</code> 0.460187→0.45 · <code>rmaj</code> 3.86192→3.85 · <code>kappa</code> 1.73951→1.74 · <code>delta</code> 0.515445→0.52 · <code>q95</code> 3.44287→3.4 · <code>cimp</code> 3.33333→3.33 · <code>dtfrac</code> 0.4001→0.4 · <code>edgene</code> 3.60738→3.6 · <code>ne0</code> 5.1534→5 ★Every other control of this bar (dt, step count, closure, the wave and beam groups) is this repository's default; FUSE's ini has no counterpart."
 },
